```

### Trans tests

b4_ro_17* is sensitive to initial conditions. Setting solver options
vmin=0.0 vmax=0.0 (see MakeList) prevents open-circuit warnings and improves
convergence.

```
b4_oneshot.gc ++!
b4_oneshot_tr1.gc ++!
b4_ro_17.gc ++?
b4_ro_17_tr1.gc ++?
b4_ro_17_tr01.gc ++?
```

### Noise tests

```
psp_noise1.gc +++
psp_noise2.gc +++
psp_noise3.gc +++
```
